// Memory (design memory-core): "What do you remember about me?" The agent answers by opening the window:
// its `buddy memory open` reaches the host (MemoryOp::Open), which opens or focuses the What I remember window.
// Replay with BUDDY_EVENTS and run `buddy memory open` against the same BUDDY_HOME at ~4 s: the log shows
// `[buddy] memory: window open`. The bear thinks, works the tool, speaks and settles as in any turn.
